        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="subtitle" value="The number of outstanding misses is a hole: the KB bounds it by Little's law and the fill buffer pool is its conjecture. The L2 indexing is measured; the prefetchers are inferred from what they cover." style="text;html=1;kind=title;fontSize=11;fontColor=#4b5563;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
